    "text": "cnaw2news.com\nwebsite\nPhenix City\nMulti-vehicle pileup shuts down JR Allen Pkwy at state line\nBy Colin,\n9 hours agoA large emergency response is underway after a multiple vehicle pileup at the Alabama-Georgia state line on JR Allen Parkway. The crash occurred shortly after 2 P.M. on Wednesday, July 30, 2025, on U.S. Highway 80 (JR Allen Parkway) just past Riverchase Drive exit in Phenix City — just before the state line — heading into Columbus. Both eastbound lanes are blocked, and one westbound lane is blocked.\n7",
